sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Frontend / curl
    participant Gin as Gin Router
    participant AuthMW as Auth Middleware
    participant RoleMW as Role Middleware
    participant Handler as RentalHandler
    participant Svc as RentalService
    participant Store as postgres.Store
    participant ToolRepo as ToolRepo
    participant RentalRepo as RentalRepo
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Client->>Gin: POST /api/rentals<br/>Authorization: Bearer ...
    Gin->>AuthMW: parse JWT
    AuthMW->>AuthMW: verify signature + exp
    AuthMW->>AuthMW: set user_id, role in context
    AuthMW->>RoleMW: RequireRole("ADMIN","STAFF")
    RoleMW->>Handler: c.Next()
    Handler->>Handler: c.ShouldBindJSON(input)
    Handler->>Svc: Handout(ctx, input)
    Svc->>Store: WithTx(fn)
    Store->>DB: BEGIN SERIALIZABLE
    Svc->>ToolRepo: GetItemByIDTx(tx, toolItemID)
    ToolRepo->>DB: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE
    DB-->>ToolRepo: row
    ToolRepo-->>Svc: ToolItem
    Svc->>Svc: business rule: rentable?
    Svc->>ToolRepo: UpdateItemStatusTx(tx, id, RENTED)
    ToolRepo->>DB: UPDATE tool_items SET status='RENTED'
    Svc->>RentalRepo: CreateTx(tx, rental)
    RentalRepo->>DB: INSERT INTO rentals RETURNING *
    DB-->>RentalRepo: row
    RentalRepo-->>Svc: Rental
    Svc->>Store: return nil
    Store->>DB: COMMIT
    Svc-->>Handler: Rental
    Handler->>Client: 201 Created (JSON)